Route118_Text_H0_0::
    .string "Bird POKéMON in the air, that's\n"
    .string "the whole of it for me.\p"
    .string "Nothing on the ground is worth\n"
    .string "looking up at.$"

Route118_Text_H0_1::
    .string "Down. All of them, down.$"

Route118_Text_H0_2::
    .string "Yours are better fed than mine.\n"
    .string "I'll see to that.$"

Route118_Text_H1::
    .string "No bridge here and no boat either.\p"
    .string "If yours knows SURF you cross in a\n"
    .string "minute. If it doesn't, you walk\l"
    .string "back to MAUVILLE.$"

Route118_Text_H2::
    .string "A GOOD ROD earns its name on this\n"
    .string "river.\p"
    .string "Ask me again in an hour and I may\n"
    .string "have changed my mind.$"

Route118_Text_H3_0::
    .string "Flowers clean a person out, body\n"
    .string "and temper both.\p"
    .string "Stand downwind of me a moment.$"

Route118_Text_H3_1::
    .string "Oh dear.\n"
    .string "That wasn't the plan.$"

Route118_Text_H3_2::
    .string "Flowers, POKéMON, rain on hot\n"
    .string "stone. Anything that smells right.\p"
    .string "The rest of the world can keep\n"
    .string "itself.$"

Route118_Text_H4_0::
    .string "Tackle matters to a FISHERMAN.\p"
    .string "To a TRAINER it's what you brought\n"
    .string "and whether you meant it.$"

Route118_Text_H4_1::
    .string "Beaten on meaning it, then.$"

Route118_Text_H4_2::
    .string "Fishing is a battle too. It's just\n"
    .string "slower and the other side never\l"
    .string "says anything.$"

Route118_Text_H5_0::
    .string "Up you go!\n"
    .string "Every one of you!$"

Route118_Text_H5_1::
    .string "Up, and then straight back down.$"

Route118_Text_H5_2::
    .string "A stronger bird flies where it\n"
    .string "likes.\p"
    .string "Mine fly where the wind says.$"

Route118_Text_H6_0::
    .string "FISHERMAN and TRAINER both.\p"
    .string "What I pull out of the river, I\n"
    .string "raise.$"

Route118_Text_H6_1::
    .string "I thought the training was going\n"
    .string "well enough.$"

Route118_Text_H6_2::
    .string "Fishing and raising at the same\n"
    .string "time.\p"
    .string "Half of each, it turns out.$"

Route118_Text_H7_0::
    .string "Stand still and let the melody\n"
    .string "get at you.$"

Route118_Text_H7_1::
    .string "La-lalala…$"

Route118_Text_H7_2::
    .string "An electric guitar doesn't have to\n"
    .string "be loud.\p"
    .string "Played quietly by a river it takes\n"
    .string "something out of your chest.$"

Route118_Text_H8_0::
    .string "Go, go, go!\n"
    .string "Number one, two and three!$"

Route118_Text_H8_1::
    .string "One, two, three, are you all right\n"
    .string "in there?$"

Route118_Text_H8_2::
    .string "I number my team. It helps.\p"
    .string "Copy me if you want, I won't\n"
    .string "mind.$"

Route118_Text_H9::
    .string "ROUTE 118\n"
    .string "{LEFT_ARROW} MAUVILLE CITY$"

Route118_Text_H10::
    .string "ROUTE 118\n"
    .string "{UP_ARROW} ROUTE 119\p"
    .string "NOTICE: the river road north is\n"
    .string "shut while the banks are rebuilt.\p"
    .string "Nobody is working on it today\n"
    .string "either.$"
